# Local scratch: generated previews, probes and shims (see scripts/)
.scratch

# Store screenshots are generated, not authored: `pnpm shots` rebuilds them from
# the shipping bundle against live sites. Committing them means they go stale
# silently — the first set outlived a panel resize and showed a shape the
# product no longer had. Upload them straight from here.
#
# docs/media/ is the exception and IS tracked: GitHub can only render a README
# image that exists in the repo, so those two are documentation rather than
# upload artifacts. `pnpm shots` refreshes them from the same capture.
/store/screenshots
